1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
Good morning, and thank you for coming in
today.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:09,800
We will start with the budget and then
talk about the schedule.

3
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:18,000
The first item is the new library building
on Mill Street.

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:37,500
It opened in March, two weeks later than
planned.

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Are there any questions before we move on?

6
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:10,500
Yes. How much did the repairs to the roof
cost in the end?

7
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:19,000
About forty thousand, which is less than
we feared.

8
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Thank you. Let us move on to the schedule
for next year.

